- **C (`SneezeSDK_C`).** New `src/sneeze_moment.c`; `include/sneeze.h` (+ `Instance_Timer` hook + MOMENT/CHRONO/PERFORMANCE/TIMER decls); `src/sneeze_objects.c` (facades, `Timer_Arm` helper); `src/sneeze_instance.c` (weak `Instance_Timer` default + `Notify` `TIMER_FIRED` decode; added `<string.h>` + `sneeze_abi.h`); `Makefile` + `README.md` add `sneeze_moment.c`. Fabric-agnostic MOMENT ops pass `FABRIC_NONE` (0).
